{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY:</h2><br>Princess Darlene has vanished. The King is completely broke.<br>His only chance is to ask his closest friends for help.<br>And one of them is a natural choice, having been there when it happened.<br>But the shock of it has wiped out most of the memory, and your only clue remains a torn parchment.<br><br>Choose among a knight, a witch, a minister even, and several others, and try to find out what happened to the King's daughter.<br>But choose well, because much more than actual professionals, these people are first and foremost the King's best friends. Will they end up heroes, or zeros?<br>You have a say in the matter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    30-40 Hours of epic and rich gameplay<br></li><li>    Visible encounters<br></li><li>    Mouse control<br></li><li>    No less than 6 modes of difficulty including unique 'Attack Mode'<br></li><li>    Choose your party among 8 different classes of characters, some of them with up to 4 different sub-classes<br></li><li>    Rename your characters - give your name or a friend's!<br></li><li>    Colyseum for you to test your skills and earn great rewards<br></li><li>    Tons of Relics and Artifacts to discover</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE GAMES DEVELOPED BY ALDORLEA:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BONUS</h2><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish with Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/461350/c8ad034fcdf0c5237355dd0135710a80d3290522.jpg"},{"name":"Finish with Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/461350/95da183c8811368f5f1e1993276b9c19b6300be3.jpg"},{"name":"Finish with Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/461350/b43a0d96ec53b0277289347ace4cf20db9f208d4.jpg"},{"name":"Finish with Priestess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/461350/6